{
    "title": "Guitar Arena - Hero Legend",
    "description": "Guitar Arena: Become a Hero of the Music World \u2013 Dive into an exhilarating rhythm game that takes you from garage band to global stardom. Experience the thrill of playing guitar across pop, rock, and heavy metal genres, and charm your fans!\r\n\r\nTAP INTO YOUR INNER ROCKSTAR\r\nTap, drag, and hold to the beat, winning over your fans and proving you're the tap hero they've been waiting for.\r\nMaster iconic tracks and rise to the top of the global leaderboard.\r\n\r\nYOUR GUITAR, YOUR HERO'S JOURNEY\r\nBuild your collection of high-definition 3D guitars in your garage.\r\nUpgrade and personalize each instrument to stand out in the pop, rock, and heavy metal scenes.\r\n\r\nGARAGE TO GLORY: BUILD YOUR OWN BAND\r\nStart from your garage, then hit the big time by playing gigs, unlocking new songs, and expanding your guitar collection.\r\nPerfect your rhythm, become a rock 'n' roll icon, and earn top ranks for each song.\r\n\r\nREVENGE OF THE BEAT HERO\r\nEnjoy dynamic gameplay with music adapted for quick sessions.\r\nWith Guitar Arena's unique fluid model, tap into your potential, master songs and rhythms, and plot your revenge as a beat hero!\r\n\r\nPlease Note: Guitar Arena is free to play, but certain game items can be purchased for real money. The game also supports offline play, so you can rock on anytime, anywhere!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Guitar Arena: Become a Hero of the Music World \u2013 Dive into an exhilarating rhythm game that takes you from garage band to global stardom. Experience the thrill of playing guitar across pop, rock, and heavy metal genres, and charm your fans!<br><br>TAP INTO YOUR INNER ROCKSTAR<br>Tap, drag, and hold to the beat, winning over your fans and proving you&#39;re the tap hero they&#39;ve been waiting for.<br>Master iconic tracks and rise to the top of the global leaderboard.<br><br>YOUR GUITAR, YOUR HERO&#39;S JOURNEY<br>Build your collection of high-definition 3D guitars in your garage.<br>Upgrade and personalize each instrument to stand out in the pop, rock, and heavy metal scenes.<br><br>GARAGE TO GLORY: BUILD YOUR OWN BAND<br>Start from your garage, then hit the big time by playing gigs, unlocking new songs, and expanding your guitar collection.<br>Perfect your rhythm, become a rock &#39;n&#39; roll icon, and earn top ranks for each song.<br><br>REVENGE OF THE BEAT HERO<br>Enjoy dynamic gameplay with music adapted for quick sessions.<br>With Guitar Arena&#39;s unique fluid model, tap into your potential, master songs and rhythms, and plot your revenge as a beat hero!<br><br>Please Note: Guitar Arena is free to play, but certain game items can be purchased for real money. The game also supports offline play, so you can rock on anytime, anywhere!",
